  Read: sparse-tail deficits should be lifted into the generated-context basis;
        raw residual coordinates are the losing quotient.

SYNTHESIS
  Sparse coordinate wins are real, but they are concentrated in low layers
  and specific Z/7 gap geometries.  The next proof target is not a raw
  coordinate inequality; it is a generated-context automaton inequality.
  HYP-2701's survival-basis gate is parallel signal: choose the basis first,
  then scalarize.
